{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978171-aimed-attainments","id":978171,"title":"Aimed Attainments?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-28T20:48:59-07:00","id":978171,"title":"Aimed Attainments?","content":"So say I have an Attainment that mimics a spell of the same level, and the only Reach available is used to &quot;cast&quot; it as an instant. Does this mean I can only use said Attainment on others via touch, or can I also &quot;throw&quot; an Attainment like one would an Aimed spell?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11689-kokiteno","name":"Kokiteno","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-28T21:25:37-07:00","id":978182,"title":"","content":"I don't see any reason why you couldn't &quot;throw&quot; an Attainment in general, although you would probably want to specify when creating the Legacy whether the attainment is supposed to be used on the mage or a different target. Attainments recreate their effects but don't have all the same flexibility of spells, I don't think you can just decide to &quot;throw&quot; an effect that's intended to target only you. I don't have any specific rules text to back that up, though.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>2E Legacy Updates</b><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/978498-2e-legacy-update-brotherhood-of-the-demon-wind\" target=\"_blank\">Brotherhood of the Demon Wind</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-ne